---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Card, AlertCard } from '../components/Card'
import { friends } from '../data/navLinks'
import { siteMetadata } from '../data/siteMetadata'
---

<BaseLayout title="朋友们">
  <div class="pt-6 pb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl leading-10 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-700 sm:leading-14 dark:text-gray-200">
      朋友们
    </h1>
    {
      friends.length === 0 ? (
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <img alt="" src="https://http.cat/418" width={325} height={300} />
        </div>
      ) : (
        <div class="columns-1 gap-10 pt-4 sm:columns-2 lg:ml-14 [&>div]:mb-8">
          {friends.map((friend) => (
            <Card
              key={friend.title}
              title={friend.title}
              href={friend.href}
              imgUrl={friend.imgUrl}
              client:load
            >
              {friend.description}
            </Card>
          ))}
        </div>
      )
    }
    {siteMetadata.friends.enable && (
      <div class="mt-10">
        <AlertCard type="primary" className="pt-4 lg:px-4" client:load>
          <details>
            <summary class="cursor-pointer">
              若您的文字也烘焙着星辰与月光，诚邀您交换一枚「奶油星云」
            </summary>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <p class="font-bold">请准备：</p>
              <ul class="list-inside list-disc py-2 pl-3">
                <li>好听的站点名！</li>
                <li>好玩的简介！</li>
                <li>好吃的地址！</li>
                <li>比例为 1:1 的，好看的图标！</li>
              </ul>
              <p>甜点车将载着您的银河碎片，缀入本店橱窗的永恒曦芒～</p>
              <a class="font-bold leading-10" href={siteMetadata.friends.formUrl}>
                填写邀请函 &rarr;
              </a>
            </div>
          </details>
        </AlertCard>
        <AlertCard type="pink" className="pt-4 lg:px-4" client:load>
          <details>
            <summary class="cursor-pointer">愿以这片「银河糖霜」点缀您的星图</summary>
            <div class="my-3 w-fit rounded-2xl border-2 border-pink-900 p-3 text-sm lg:text-base dark:border-pink-300">
              <p>
                <strong>星星碎片收容所</strong> &bull; Alex3236
              </p>
              <p>https://space.alex3236.moe</p>
              <p>把星星揉进面团里，用月光当裱花袋～</p>
              <p>
                <a class="underline underline-offset-3" href="/static/assets/favicon.png">
                  FAVICON (PNG, 512*512)
                </a>
                &nbsp;或&nbsp;
                <a
                  class="underline underline-offset-3"
                  href="https://github.com/alex3236.png"
                >
                  AVATAR (PNG, 450*450)
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <p>若愿接续这缕星轨，许我将釉色罐盏盛满暗物质曲奇，回赠至您的数据银河。</p>
            <a class="font-bold leading-10" href={siteMetadata.friends.formUrl}>
              填写邀请函 &rarr;
            </a>
          </details>
        </AlertCard>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
